OL,3,AMartha Stewart says she 'really screwed
OL,4,Aup' with homeless Halloween costume
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran lifestyle guru Martha Stewart
OL,7,Fhas admitted she "really screwed up" by
OL,8,Fdressing as a homeless person for
OL,9,FHalloween.
OL,11,FThe 85-year-old US entrepreneur and
OL,12,Fpersonality has deleted a photo of
OL,13,Fherself wearing torn clothes and dirt
OL,14,Fon her face, holding a sign saying: "I
OL,15,Fam hungry help me!!"
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
