OL,3,AJack Lowden says James Bond speculation
OL,4,Ais 'flattering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlow Horses star Jack Lowden has
OL,7,Fdescribed the speculation he could be
OL,8,Fthe next James Bond as "flattering".
OL,10,FThe 36-year-old - who grew up in Oxton
OL,11,Fin the Scottish Borders - has been
OL,12,Freported to be in the running for the
OL,13,Frole alongside Callum Turner and Josh
OL,14,FO'Connor.
OL,16,FThe actor chosen will replace Daniel
OL,17,FCraig, who took over the role of Bond
OL,18,Fwith Casino Royale in 2006 and bowed
OL,19,Fout after his fifth film, No Time To
OL,20,FDie, in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
